// ================================================== the externs =============

// ----- js_dict_new ------------------------------------------------------------
// js_dict_new is SHARED - lib/runtime.metajs.


// ----- js_pyidx ---------------------------------------------------------------
// Sequence indexing (negative wraps; a str by CODE POINT), dict lookup, the
